{"unit_id": "johnhom1024__dsh-loopback-bridge#feature-1", "repo": "johnhom1024/dsh-loopback-bridge", "commit": "395a7554a0f991798bdaba0c8ec18604dcc8ba80", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-loopback-bridge 的功能「远程设置页」：把浏览器连接标记为 loopback，使 DSH 设置页在非回环 hostname 下能够使用。页面载入时注入脚本，并在 connection 模块应用后设置标记。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/bridge.js:1-35", "lib/index.js:53-81"]}
