{"unit_id": "johnhom1024__dsh-loopback-bridge#feature-3", "repo": "johnhom1024/dsh-loopback-bridge", "commit": "395a7554a0f991798bdaba0c8ec18604dcc8ba80", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-loopback-bridge 的功能「客户端补充标记」：注册客户端 fiber 并依赖 connection 服务，在 apply 时将 connection.isLoopback 设为 true，作为脚本桥接之外的补充路径。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:1-41"]}
{"unit_id": "johnhom1024__dsh-loopback-bridge#caveat-1", "repo": "johnhom1024/dsh-loopback-bridge", "commit": "395a7554a0f991798bdaba0c8ec18604dcc8ba80", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-loopback-bridge 使用前须知：代码会把浏览器连接标记为 loopback，以便启用设置写入；远程入口应由服务端 trusted-host 和访问鉴权限制。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/bridge.js:1-35", "lib/client.js:17-39"]}
